1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,541
A grass embryo starts the same way, but makes only one cotyledon, and it lies to one side of a huge endosperm.

2
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:14,010
That single cotyledon is the shield shaped scutellum, pressed against the endosperm.

3
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:18,880
Its surface layer secretes enzymes and absorbs the digested food.

